// domainRules are the per-domain deltas layered onto baseRules. A delta is
// tighten-only: it adds reservations/hides, never removes a base one. Only the
// GitHub-mirror domain adds rules today.
func domainRules(d Domain) rules {
	if d == DomainGitHubMirror {
